				Hdt.
				1.110
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρεα . . ἴδῃσι καὶ χιόνι
			ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.111
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.1.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				5.4.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σᾶμα . . πτελέῃσι ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.141
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Antiphil.
			</span></i>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. χώρα, λόφος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Marc.</u>
				29
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Anach.</u>
				18
